\f0 \b Software Information and Important Reminders:\b0\par
\f0 \par
\f0 NekoProxy is a cross-platform graphical application for deploying network protocols and managing servers. It provides only the related software tools and functionality; it does not provide proxy nodes, network access, server hosting, or any other additional network services.\par
\f0 \par
\f0 If you have questions about network connectivity, service availability, or network service quality, please contact your network service provider. Issues with the software itself may be reported through GitHub Issues or other feedback channels.\par
\f0 \par
\f0 When connecting to a server, carefully verify its SSH host key fingerprint and do not ignore security warnings in the app. Keep your SSH credentials, proxy node information, and exported configuration files secure to prevent the disclosure of sensitive information.\par
